2	Scheduled Verifications	Institute routine multi-level checks across school, district, and national levels.
3	Action Tracking	Assign every flagged mismatch a case number, reviewer, and resolution deadline.
4	Pilot Implementation	Test digital control modules in selected pilot districts prior to national rollout.
